    <briefdescription>
<para>Generalized Hull-White model class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements the standard Black-Karasinski model defined by <formula id="138">\[ d f(r_t) = (\theta(t) - \alpha f(r_t))dt + \sigma dW_t, \]</formula> where <formula id="139">$ alpha $</formula> and <formula id="140">$ sigma $</formula> are piecewise linear functions. </para>    </detaileddescription>
